I just finished babysitting a script to copy index entries from the
old word doc version of the CLL to the new docbook version that will
eventually become our new print version.

To save people having to manually create about 5100 index entries, I
spent 20+ hours figuring out how to fuzilly match two documents with
totally different markup, and massaging one document to match the
other.

That's my Christmas present for y'all.

Be impressed.

